      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "HAO Yü 郝浴 (T. 冰滌, 雪海, H. 復陽), 1623–1683, Sept. 5, official, was a native of Ting-chou, Chihli. He became a chin-shih in 1649 and one year later was appointed an assistant secretary in the Board of Punishments.",
